> crit x - sin(x)
critical points of x - sin(x):
  x - sin(x)' = 1 - cos(x)
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, x - sin(x) = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit 2x - sin(2x)
critical points of 2x - sin(2x):
  2x - sin(2x)' = 2 - 2cos(2x)
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, 2x - sin(2x) = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit x + sin(x)
critical points of x + sin(x):
  x + sin(x)' = cos(x) + 1
  none in [-10, 10]
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit x - tan(x)
critical points of x - tan(x):
  x - tan(x)' = 1 - 1/cos(x)^2
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, x - tan(x) = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit sinh(x) - x
critical points of sinh(x) - x:
  sinh(x) - x' = cosh(x) - 1
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, sinh(x) - x = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> a(x: real in 3..3.3) = x - tan(x)
> crit a
critical points of a:
  a' = 1 - 1/cos(x)^2
  none in [3, 3.3]
> b(x: real in -3.3..-3) = x - tan(x)
> crit b
critical points of b:
